      "writtenOn": "2023-11-08T01:03:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, `1 \u003c\u003c n`. Anyway, I\u0027m not suggesting a change.\n\nThough, if you don\u0027t actually need to use \u0027bit index\u0027 in code and you just need to use the bit mask, it would be okay to change.",
